# Runtime state leaked into src-tauri/ by the Plan-1 CWD-home bug (the Tauri
# shell ran with CWD=src-tauri before 2a anchored TESSERACT_HOME per-user).
# These hold REAL operator data — vault docs, memories, session dumps, channel
# tokens, controller state. Untracked-but-unignored was one `git add -A` away
# from publishing them. Never commit; the source tree under src-tauri/ (src/,
# capabilities/, tauri.conf.json, Cargo.*) stays tracked.
tesseract/mirror/src-tauri/agenda/
tesseract/mirror/src-tauri/memory-store/
tesseract/mirror/src-tauri/run/
tesseract/mirror/src-tauri/sessions/
tesseract/mirror/src-tauri/tars_controller/
tesseract/mirror/src-tauri/telegram/
tesseract/mirror/src-tauri/vault/
